{"kind": "header", "ayanamsha": "surya_siddhanta", "location": {"lat": 27.7, "lon": 85.32, "timezone": "Asia/Kathmandu", "name": "Kathmandu", "city_id": 1283240}, "birth_instant": "1993-08-21T14:30:00+05:45"}
{"kind": "meta", "lagna": {"sign": 8, "name_en": "Vrishchika", "name_ne": "वृश्चिक"}, "moon_sign": {"sign": 6, "name_en": "Kanya", "name_ne": "कन्या"}, "sun_sign": {"sign": 5, "name_en": "Simha", "name_ne": "सिंह"}, "nakshatra": {"name_en": "Hasta", "name_ne": "हस्त", "pada": 4, "lord_en": "Moon"}, "mahadasha": {"lord": "jupiter", "lord_en": "Jupiter", "lord_ne": "बृहस्पति", "ends": "23 Apr 2036", "antardasha": "mercury", "antardasha_en": "Mercury", "antardasha_ne": "बुध", "antardasha_ends": "31 Mar 2027", "window": ["2020-04-23T20:44:04.283502+00:00", "2036-04-23T17:51:16.283502+00:00"]}, "yoga_count": 32, "generated_at": "2026-11-15T06:30:00.123456+00:00", "method": "Deterministic Parashari interpretation with confidence weighting", "disclaimer": "For reflection and cultural insight. Describes tendencies and probabilities, not certainties; not a substitute for professional advice."}
{"kind": "section", "index": 0, "total": 25, "id": "executive_summary", "title_en": "Executive summary", "title_ne": "सारांश", "body": ["Three things set the tone of your whole chart: your rising sign (how you come across to others), your Moon (your emotions and mind), and your Sun (your core self). Here, Vrishchika is rising, your Moon is in Kanya (birth star Hasta), and your Sun is in Simha.", "In plain terms, you tend to come across to others as intense, private and strong-willed.", "The planet ruling your rising sign, Mars, is in your 11th house and a little strained there, so overall your chart rests on a moderately supported foundation.", "Where you are now: you're in Jupiter's main life period (mahadasha) until 23 Apr 2036, and the current sub-phase within it (antardasha) belongs to Mercury, running 23 Dec 2024 – 31 Mar 2027. The Life-period timeline section gives the full schedule with dates.", "Helpful combinations (yogas) active in your chart: Gaja-Kesari Yoga, Kemadruma Bhanga Raja Yoga, Veshi Yoga, Vasi Yoga, Ubhayachari Yoga, Pushkala Yoga, Parijata Yoga, Raja Yoga, Ardha Chandra Yoga, Kedara Yoga, Swaveeryaddhana Yoga (III), Matrumooladdhana Yoga, Bhratruvriddhi Yoga, Matru Sneha Yoga, Vahana Yoga (I), Satputra Yoga, Buddhimaturya Yoga, Satkalatra Yoga, Raja Yoga (III), Raja Yoga (XIV) — each is explained in plain words in the Yogas section below."], "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Shadbala: lagna lord strong", "Yogas: 21 supportive combination(s)"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 1, "total": 25, "id": "personality", "title_en": "Personality & temperament", "title_ne": "व्यक्तित्व", "body": ["To other people, you usually come across as intense, private and strong-willed (Vrishchika rising).", "How you present yourself is shaped most by Mars (the planet ruling your rising sign), so energy, courage and taking action is a big part of your outward style.", "Deeper down, your sense of self and drive is built around confidence and leadership (your Sun is in Simha).", "The way you think and communicate leans toward clear thinking, communication and learning."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D9: Mars dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong", "D1: Mars in an enemy sign"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 2, "total": 25, "id": "emotional_nature", "title_en": "Emotional nature", "title_ne": "भावनात्मक स्वभाव", "body": ["Emotionally, you tend to be practical, careful and good with detail (your Moon is in Kanya).", "Your sense of emotional security is mainly tied to gains, networks, aspirations and elder siblings. Your mind tends to stay naturally steady."], "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Moon in a friendly sign", "D9: Moon dignified in navamsa"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 3, "total": 25, "id": "strengths", "title_en": "Core strengths", "title_ne": "बल पक्ष", "body": ["Your strongest areas are: confidence and leadership; discipline, patience and steady hard work; energy, courage and taking action; learning, good judgement and steady growth. These come more naturally to you, so you can lean on them and build on them with confidence."], "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Sun dignified/strong", "Saturn dignified/strong", "Mars dignified/strong", "Jupiter dignified/strong"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 4, "total": 25, "id": "challenges", "title_en": "Growth challenges", "title_ne": "चुनौती", "body": ["Clear thinking, communication and learning may not come as easily to you, and can take conscious effort and practice.", "Treat these as growth edges: areas that reward patience and skill-building, not fixed limitations."], "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Mercury weak/debilitated"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 5, "total": 25, "id": "career", "title_en": "Career & vocation", "title_ne": "पेशा / कर्म", "body": ["This area of life is about career, status, public role and worldly action. The planet in charge of it, Sun, currently sits in the part of your chart about career, and is very comfortable and strong there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Sun.", "Your career direction is set by the planet that rules your career area, Sun, moving into your 10th house — so your public work blends with career.", "Sun and Saturn together describe the balance between authority/visibility and disciplined hard work in your working life.", "You're currently in Jupiter's main life period, which right now colours your career with growth, wisdom, teaching, finances, children and good counsel."], "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 10th lord Sun well dignified", "D1: 10th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 10th)", "Shadbala: 10th lord Exceptional", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Sun"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 6, "total": 25, "id": "finances", "title_en": "Finances & wealth", "title_ne": "धन / वित्त", "body": ["This area of life is about wealth, speech, family lineage and nourishment. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is a little strained there (overall strength strong).", "This area of life is about gains, networks, aspirations and elder siblings. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about fortune, and is a little strained there (overall strength weak). Planets currently in this area: Moon, Mars, Jupiter.", "Jupiter, the planet naturally linked to wealth and good fortune, is in Kanya (your 11th house) — a little strained there.", "A wealth-forming Dhana yoga supports accumulation through steady earning and saving habits.", "Finances respond best to systematic saving; the chart describes tendencies, while habits decide outcomes."], "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Shadbala: 2nd lord Strong", "D1: 11th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 9th)", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Moon, Jupiter", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Mars", "Yoga: Dhana yoga present", "Shadbala: 11th lord Weak"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 7, "total": 25, "id": "relationships", "title_en": "Relationships & partnership", "title_ne": "सम्बन्ध", "body": ["This area of life is about partnership, marriage, business and public dealings. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about fortune, and is a little strained there (overall strength adequate). Planets currently in this area: Ketu.", "Venus, the planet linked to love and partnership, is in Karka (your 9th house) — a little strained there. It describes what you value and look for in closeness.", "A challenging influence on the partnership house suggests relationships mature through some testing — open communication and shared values smooth the path. This is a tendency, not a fixed outcome."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: 7th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 9th)", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Ketu"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 8, "total": 25, "id": "family", "title_en": "Family & home", "title_ne": "परिवार", "body": ["This area of life is about home, mother, inner peace, property and education. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is steady and self-assured there (overall strength exceptional).", "This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is well supported there (overall strength adequate). Planets currently in this area: Mercury, Venus.", "This area of life is about courage, effort, siblings, communication and skill. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is steady and self-assured there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Saturn.", "The 4th reflects mother and home, the 9th the father and elders, the 2nd the wider family, and the 3rd siblings."], "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: 4th lord Saturn well dignified", "Shadbala: 4th lord Exceptional"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 9, "total": 25, "id": "health_wellbeing", "title_en": "Health & wellbeing", "title_ne": "स्वास्थ्य", "body": ["In Vedic astrology, your vitality is read from the rising sign, its ruling planet, and the Moon; the 6th house describes illness, recovery and daily routine.", "Your rising-sign ruler Mars (in your 11th house, a little strained there) asks for proactive self-care — regular sleep, movement and stress management have outsized benefit.", "This area of life is about work, service, health, competition and obstacles. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is a little strained there (overall strength strong).", "This is wellbeing guidance from chart tendencies, not medical advice; consult a qualified professional for any concern."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D9: Mars dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong", "D1: Mars in an enemy sign"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 10, "total": 25, "id": "spiritual_growth", "title_en": "Spiritual growth", "title_ne": "आध्यात्मिक विकास", "body": ["This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is well supported there (overall strength adequate). Planets currently in this area: Mercury, Venus.", "This area of life is about release, expenses, retreat, foreign lands and liberation. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about fortune, and is a little strained there (overall strength adequate).", "Jupiter in house 11 points to where wisdom, ethics and mentorship naturally develop.", "Ketu in house 7 (Vrishabha) shows where you carry instinctive mastery and a pull toward detachment."], "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: natural benefic(s) present — Mercury, Venus"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 11, "total": 25, "id": "current_life_phase", "title_en": "Current life phase", "title_ne": "वर्तमान जीवन-कालखण्ड", "body": ["You're in Jupiter's main life period (mahadasha) until 23 Apr 2036, and the current sub-phase within it (antardasha) belongs to Mercury, from 23 Dec 2024 to 31 Mar 2027. This phase emphasises growth, wisdom, teaching, finances, children and good counsel.", "Jupiter sits in your 11th house and rules your 2nd, 5th houses, so the period concentrates on gains and the houses it rules. It is a little strained — These results tend to arrive readily.", "Within it, the Mercury sub-period sharpens the theme of study (linked to your 9th house) until 31 Mar 2027."], "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D9: Jupiter dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong", "Dasha: Jupiter runs the current mahadasha", "D1: Jupiter in an enemy sign"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 12, "total": 25, "id": "life_journey", "title_en": "Life journey — past, present & future", "title_ne": "जीवन यात्रा — विगत, वर्तमान र भविष्य", "body": ["Your life is divided into long chapters (called mahadashas in astrology), and each one emphasises a different part of life. Below are the chapters you have already lived, the one running now, and the ones ahead — with ages — so you can see at a glance which stage of life emphasises what."], "items": [{"label": "Moon life period (balance at birth) · age 0–1 (past)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "21 Aug 1993 → 24 Apr 1995 (2 yrs): This chapter built experience around emotional life, home, public contact and care-giving."}, {"label": "Mars life period · age 1–8 (past)", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "24 Apr 1995 → 24 Apr 2002 (7 yrs): This chapter built experience around drive, property, technical or competitive effort and bold initiative."}, {"label": "Rahu life period · age 8–26 (past)", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "24 Apr 2002 → 23 Apr 2020 (18 yrs): This chapter built experience around ambition, unconventional or foreign avenues and rapid change."}, {"label": "Jupiter life period · age 26–42 (present · you are here)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "23 Apr 2020 → 23 Apr 2036 (16 yrs): You are living this chapter now — growth, wisdom, teaching, finances, children and good counsel is foregrounded."}, {"label": "Saturn life period · age 42–61 (ahead)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "23 Apr 2036 → 24 Apr 2055 (19 yrs): This coming chapter brings discipline, hard work, responsibility, structure and patience to the fore."}, {"label": "Mercury life period · age 61–78 (ahead)", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "24 Apr 2055 → 23 Apr 2072 (17 yrs): This coming chapter brings study, communication, trade, writing and analytical work to the fore."}, {"label": "Ketu life period · age 78–85 (ahead)", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "23 Apr 2072 → 24 Apr 2079 (7 yrs): This coming chapter brings detachment, specialisation, inner work and spiritual turns to the fore."}, {"label": "Venus life period · age 85–105 (ahead)", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "24 Apr 2079 → 24 Apr 2099 (20 yrs): This coming chapter brings relationships, comfort, creativity, the arts and material ease to the fore."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 13, "total": 25, "id": "dasha_timeline", "title_en": "Life-period timeline (with dates)", "title_ne": "जीवन-कालखण्ड तालिका", "body": ["The schedule of sub-periods inside your current Jupiter life period, and the big life periods that follow — the most precise timing layer of your chart."], "items": [{"label": "Mercury sub-period · running now", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "23 Dec 2024 → 31 Mar 2027: study — linked to your 9th house."}, {"label": "Ketu sub-period", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "31 Mar 2027 → 6 Mar 2028: detachment — linked to your 7th house."}, {"label": "Saturn life period (next major chapter)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Begins 23 Apr 2036, lasting to 24 Apr 2055 (19 yrs): a discipline chapter."}, {"label": "Mercury life period (next major chapter)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Begins 24 Apr 2055, lasting to 23 Apr 2072 (17 yrs): a study chapter."}, {"label": "Ketu life period (next major chapter)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Begins 23 Apr 2072, lasting to 24 Apr 2079 (7 yrs): a detachment chapter."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 14, "total": 25, "id": "outlook_12_months", "title_en": "Outlook — next 12 months", "title_ne": "आगामी १२ महिना", "body": ["The year ahead is led by Mercury's sub-period (through 31 Mar 2027), bringing study, communication, trade, writing and analytical work to the fore.", "It is under some pressure (in your 9th house), so pace efforts and prepare rather than force outcomes in its areas.", "A shift to come: the Ketu sub-period opens 31 Mar 2027, bringing detachment to the foreground."], "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D9: Jupiter dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong", "Dasha: Jupiter runs the current mahadasha", "D1: Jupiter in an enemy sign"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 15, "total": 25, "id": "pursue_and_when", "title_en": "What to pursue & when", "title_ne": "के कुरामा लाग्ने र कहिले", "body": ["This section shows what to focus on and the best time for each one. Every life area below comes with the period that most favours it — try to line up your bigger decisions with those good times."], "items": [{"label": "Your strongest area", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "You are naturally good at confidence and leadership — effort pays off fastest here, so put most of your energy into it. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (5 Nov 2030 → 24 Aug 2031)."}, {"label": "Career & work", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Make your bigger moves in career, status and public role. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (5 Nov 2030 → 24 Aug 2031)."}, {"label": "Wealth & gains", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "Expand income streams, networks and aspirations. Best time for this: a good period running now (23 Dec 2024 → 31 Mar 2027)."}, {"label": "Relationships & partnership", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "Advance marriage, partnership or public collaboration. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (6 Mar 2028 → 5 Nov 2030)."}, {"label": "Learning, dharma & mentors", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Invest in higher learning, travel, mentors and spiritual practice. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (24 Aug 2031 → 23 Dec 2032)."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 16, "total": 25, "id": "opportunities", "title_en": "Opportunities", "title_ne": "अवसर", "body": ["The 11th house (gains) is well supported — a natural area to invest energy.", "Gaja-Kesari Yoga: Formed when Jupiter sits in an angle (kendra) from the Moon — a classic combination for good judgement, respect and steady fortune that tends to ripen with maturity.", "Kemadruma Bhanga Raja Yoga: The Moon is structurally isolated (2nd/12th empty) but a planet occupies an angle from the Lagna, cancelling Kemadruma — classically turning it into a Raja yoga for wealth and standing earned through one's own effort.", "Veshi Yoga: Planets occupy the 2nd house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for truthful speech, integrity and recognition through principled action.", "Vasi Yoga: Planets occupy the 12th house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for charity, spiritual merit and influence through selfless service.", "Ubhayachari Yoga: Planets flank the Sun on both the 2nd and 12th sides — a balanced Surya yoga for all-round ability, balanced temperament and success in both worldly and dharmic pursuits.", "Pushkala Yoga: The lagna lord and the Moon share a sign — a Pushkala yoga for fame, popularity and a personality that draws people and opportunities.", "Parijata Yoga: The dispositor of the lagna lord's sign, or the Navamsa lord of that dispositor, falls in a kendra, trikona, or own/exaltation sign — a Parijata yoga for happiness in mid and later life, honoured by leaders.", "Raja Yoga: Formed when the angular lord (Mars) and the trine lord (Jupiter) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong.", "Raja Yoga: Formed when the angular lord (Mars) and the trine lord (Moon) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong.", "Ardha Chandra Yoga: All seven planets occupy seven contiguous houses beginning from a Panapara or Apoklima house — an Ardha Chandra yoga for fine features, lifelong happiness and command.", "Kedara Yoga: All seven planets spread across exactly 4 distinct sign(s) (a Sankhya Nabhasa yoga) — classically: Earns a livelihood by agriculture, helpful.", "Swaveeryaddhana Yoga (III): The 2nd lord holds an angle or trine from the lagna lord, or a benefic 2nd lord is deeply exalted or joined by an exalted planet — a Swaveeryaddhana yoga for self-earned wealth.", "Matrumooladdhana Yoga: The 2nd lord joins or is aspected by the 4th lord — money earned with a mother's help.", "Bhratruvriddhi Yoga: The 3rd lord, Mars, or the 3rd house is joined or aspected by benefics — happiness through prosperous brothers.", "Matru Sneha Yoga: The lagna and 4th lords share lordship, are natural or temporal friends, or the 4th is aspected by a benefic — cordial relations between mother and son.", "Vahana Yoga (I): The lagna lord joins the 4th, 9th, or 11th house — material comforts and conveyances.", "Satputra Yoga: Jupiter rules the 5th while the Sun is favourably placed — a worthy, dutiful son.", "Buddhimaturya Yoga: A benefic 5th lord is aspected by another benefic, or sits in a benefic sign — great intelligence and character.", "Satkalatra Yoga: The 7th lord or Venus links to Jupiter or Mercury — a noble, chaste and virtuous spouse.", "Raja Yoga (III): Two to four planets possess Digbala (directional strength) — a ruler even from an ordinary family.", "Raja Yoga (XIV): One of the 11th/9th/2nd lords holds an angle from the Moon while Jupiter rules the 2nd, 5th or 11th — greatness and high leadership."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 17, "total": 25, "id": "cautions", "title_en": "Areas for caution", "title_ne": "सावधानी", "body": ["Keep a steady hand with transformation (the 8th house) — manage rather than force.", "Vanchana Chora Bheeti Yoga: The Lagna holds a malefic with Gulika in a trine, or Gulika joins a kendra/trikona lord, or the lagna lord conjoins Rahu, Saturn or Ketu — a caution yoga classically linked to suspicion, fear of being cheated, swindled or robbed; clear boundaries and verifying people/deals directly help.", "Dehakashta Yoga: The lagna lord joins a malefic or sits in the 8th house — a Dehakashta yoga pointing to reduced bodily comfort.", "Daridra Yoga (149): The lagna lord is associated with a 6th/8th/12th lord and subjected to malefic aspects — dire poverty and want.", "Bandhubhisthyaktha Yoga: The 4th lord is associated with malefics or sits in an inimical/debilitated sign — deserted by relatives.", "Matrunasa Yoga (I): The Moon is hemmed in between, joined by, or aspected by malefics — a very early death of the mother.", "Matru Satrutwa Yoga: The lagna and 4th lords are natural or temporal enemies — ill feeling between mother and son.", "Anapathya Yoga: Jupiter and the lords of the Lagna, 7th and 5th are all weak — a caution yoga for childlessness or loss of children.", "Khalawata Yoga: The Ascendant falls in a malefic sign, aspected by malefics — early baldness.", "None of these are predictions of misfortune — they are areas where awareness and moderation protect your progress."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 18, "total": 25, "id": "practical_recommendations", "title_en": "Practical recommendations", "title_ne": "व्यावहारिक सुझाव", "body": ["Play to your strengths — confidence and leadership. This is where progress comes easiest for you.", "Don't avoid your weaker side — clear thinking, communication and learning. Build it up slowly with small, regular habits instead of waiting until you feel ready.", "Save big decisions for the good times highlighted above, so you act when the timing is on your side.", "Pick one small habit for each priority below and stick with it for the next three months."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 19, "total": 25, "id": "spiritual_practices", "title_en": "Traditional spiritual practices (optional)", "title_ne": "पारम्परिक उपाय (वैकल्पिक)", "body": ["These are traditional, faith-based remedies offered as optional support — they are cultural practices, not requirements or guarantees.", "For strengthening Mercury themes, classical texts suggest its weekday observance, charity associated with Mercury, and respectful, calm conduct in that life area.", "Gratitude practices around Sun themes help you make the most of an existing strength.", "Above all, ethical action (sadachara) and steadiness are the remedies every tradition agrees on."], "optional": true}
{"kind": "section", "index": 20, "total": 25, "id": "planet_by_planet", "title_en": "Planet by planet", "title_ne": "ग्रह विश्लेषण", "body": [], "items": [{"label": "Sun (सूर्य)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Sun very comfortable and strong", "Shadbala: Exceptional"], "text": "Sun is in Simha at 3°00′ (birth star Magha, quarter 2), in your 10th house; and is very comfortable and strong there. In life it stands for soul, vitality, father, authority and self-confidence. Its overall strength is exceptional."}, {"label": "Moon (चन्द्र)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Moon in a friendly sign", "D9: Moon dignified in navamsa"], "text": "Moon is in Kanya at 21°06′ (birth star Hasta, quarter 4), in your 11th house; and is well supported there. In life it stands for mind, emotions, mother, comfort and the public. Its overall strength is adequate."}, {"label": "Mars (मंगल)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D9: Mars dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong", "D1: Mars in an enemy sign"], "text": "Mars is in Kanya at 11°31′ (birth star Hasta, quarter 1), in your 11th house; and is a little strained there. In life it stands for energy, courage, drive, siblings and property. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Mercury (बुध)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Dasha: Mercury runs the current antardasha", "D1: Mercury in an enemy sign", "D9: Mercury weak in navamsa", "Shadbala: Weak"], "text": "Mercury is in Karka at 28°04′ (birth star Ashlesha, quarter 4), in your 9th house; and is a little strained there; very close to the Sun (combust), so its outer results take extra effort. In life it stands for intellect, communication, commerce and learning. Its overall strength is weak."}, {"label": "Jupiter (बृहस्पति)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D9: Jupiter dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong", "Dasha: Jupiter runs the current mahadasha", "D1: Jupiter in an enemy sign"], "text": "Jupiter is in Kanya at 23°00′ (birth star Hasta, quarter 4), in your 11th house; and is a little strained there. In life it stands for wisdom, ethics, wealth, teachers, children and grace. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Venus (शुक्र)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D9: vargottama (same sign in navamsa — reinforced)", "D1: Venus in an enemy sign"], "text": "Venus is in Karka at 1°46′ (birth star Punarvasu, quarter 4), in your 9th house; and is a little strained there; in the same sign in both main charts (vargottama), which makes it noticeably stronger. In life it stands for love, partnership, beauty, comfort and the arts. Its overall strength is adequate."}, {"label": "Saturn (शनि)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Saturn steady and self-assured", "Shadbala: Exceptional"], "text": "Saturn is in Makara at 24°23′ (birth star Dhanishta, quarter 1), in your 3rd house; and is steady and self-assured there; moving backwards for now (retrograde), so its themes turn inward and get revisited. In life it stands for discipline, endurance, work, service and longevity. Its overall strength is exceptional."}, {"label": "Rahu (राहु)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": [], "text": "Rahu is in Vrishchika at 18°13′ (birth star Jyeshtha, quarter 1), in your 1st house. In life it stands for ambition, foreign and unconventional paths, obsession."}, {"label": "Ketu (केतु)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": [], "text": "Ketu is in Vrishabha at 18°13′ (birth star Rohini, quarter 3), in your 7th house. In life it stands for detachment, intuition, past mastery and liberation."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 21, "total": 25, "id": "house_by_house", "title_en": "House by house", "title_ne": "भाव विश्लेषण", "body": [], "items": [{"label": "Self (house 1)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 1st lord Strong", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Rahu"], "text": "This area of life is about self, body, vitality and overall life direction. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is a little strained there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Rahu."}, {"label": "Wealth (house 2)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Shadbala: 2nd lord Strong"], "text": "This area of life is about wealth, speech, family lineage and nourishment. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is a little strained there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Courage (house 3)", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 3rd lord Saturn well dignified", "Shadbala: 3rd lord Exceptional", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Saturn"], "text": "This area of life is about courage, effort, siblings, communication and skill. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is steady and self-assured there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Saturn."}, {"label": "Home (house 4)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: 4th lord Saturn well dignified", "Shadbala: 4th lord Exceptional"], "text": "This area of life is about home, mother, inner peace, property and education. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is steady and self-assured there (overall strength exceptional)."}, {"label": "Intelligence (house 5)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Shadbala: 5th lord Strong"], "text": "This area of life is about intelligence, creativity, children and past merit. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is a little strained there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Work (house 6)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Shadbala: 6th lord Strong"], "text": "This area of life is about work, service, health, competition and obstacles. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is a little strained there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Partnership (house 7)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: 7th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 9th)", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Ketu"], "text": "This area of life is about partnership, marriage, business and public dealings. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about fortune, and is a little strained there (overall strength adequate). Planets currently in this area: Ketu."}, {"label": "Transformation (house 8)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: 8th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 9th)", "Shadbala: 8th lord Weak"], "text": "This area of life is about transformation, shared resources, research and longevity. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about fortune, and is a little strained there (overall strength weak)."}, {"label": "Fortune (house 9)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: natural benefic(s) present — Mercury, Venus"], "text": "This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is well supported there (overall strength adequate). Planets currently in this area: Mercury, Venus."}, {"label": "Career (house 10)", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 10th lord Sun well dignified", "D1: 10th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 10th)", "Shadbala: 10th lord Exceptional", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Sun"], "text": "This area of life is about career, status, public role and worldly action. The planet in charge of it, Sun, currently sits in the part of your chart about career, and is very comfortable and strong there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Sun."}, {"label": "Gains (house 11)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: 11th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 9th)", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Moon, Jupiter", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Mars", "Shadbala: 11th lord Weak"], "text": "This area of life is about gains, networks, aspirations and elder siblings. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about fortune, and is a little strained there (overall strength weak). Planets currently in this area: Moon, Mars, Jupiter."}, {"label": "Release (house 12)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: 12th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 9th)"], "text": "This area of life is about release, expenses, retreat, foreign lands and liberation. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about fortune, and is a little strained there (overall strength adequate)."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 22, "total": 25, "id": "divisional_charts", "title_en": "Divisional charts (D-charts) summary", "title_ne": "वर्ग चक्र (D-चार्ट) सारांश", "body": ["Divisional (varga) charts subdivide each rashi of the birth chart into finer parts, and each one zooms in on a specific area of life. Below is a short reading of what every major D-chart is read for and how strong that area looks in this chart."], "items": [{"label": "D9 — Navamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Moon: steady and self-assured", "Mars: steady and self-assured", "Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Jupiter: at its very best and very strong", "Venus: vargottama"], "text": "The D9 chart (Navamsa) shows your marriage, dharma, fortune and the inner strength of every planet. Moon, Mars, Jupiter, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D10 — Dasamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Jupiter: steady and self-assured", "Venus: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D10 chart (Dasamsa) shows your career, profession, status and public achievement. Jupiter, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D7 — Saptamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong, keeps its natal sign", "Moon: steady and self-assured", "Mercury: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D7 chart (Saptamsa) shows your children, progeny and creative continuity. Sun, Moon, Mercury are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D4 — Chaturthamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong, keeps its natal sign", "Venus: keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D4 chart (Chaturthamsa) shows your home, land, property and inner contentment. Sun, Saturn, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D12 — Dwadashamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Moon: at its very best and very strong", "Mars: at its very best and very strong", "Mercury: steady and self-assured", "Venus: keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D12 chart (Dwadashamsa) shows your parents, lineage and inherited karma. Moon, Mars, Mercury, Saturn, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D24 — Chaturvimsamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Moon: weak and needing conscious effort", "Mars: steady and self-assured", "Jupiter: weak and needing conscious effort", "Saturn: very comfortable and strong"], "text": "The D24 chart (Chaturvimsamsa) shows your education, learning and scholarship. Mars, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Moon, Jupiter are under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D2 — Hora", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong, keeps its natal sign", "Mars: weak and needing conscious effort", "Venus: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D2 chart (Hora) shows your wealth, resources and material sustenance. Sun, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Mars is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D3 — Drekkana", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong, keeps its natal sign", "Moon: at its very best and very strong", "Mars: at its very best and very strong", "Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Venus: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D3 chart (Drekkana) shows your siblings, courage and personal initiative. Sun, Moon, Mars, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D16 — Shodashamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Sun: weak and needing conscious effort", "Moon: weak and needing conscious effort", "Mercury: steady and self-assured", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D16 chart (Shodashamsa) shows your vehicles, comforts and material pleasures. Mercury, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Sun, Moon are under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D20 — Vimsamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Venus: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D20 chart (Vimsamsa) shows your spiritual practice, devotion and religious merit. Venus is strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D27 — Bhamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Jupiter: steady and self-assured", "Saturn: weak and needing conscious effort"], "text": "The D27 chart (Bhamsa) shows your innate strengths, weaknesses and stamina. Jupiter is strong here, which helps this area. Saturn is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D30 — Trimsamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: at its very best and very strong", "Mars: keeps its natal sign", "Jupiter: weak and needing conscious effort", "Venus: steady and self-assured", "Saturn: steady and self-assured, keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D30 chart (Trimsamsa) shows your adversity, health risks and moral fibre. Sun, Venus, Saturn, Mars are strong here, which helps this area. Jupiter is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D60 — Shashtiamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Jupiter: at its very best and very strong", "Venus: steady and self-assured", "Saturn: steady and self-assured, keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D60 chart (Shashtiamsa) shows your the sum of past-life karma standing behind the whole chart. Jupiter, Venus, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 23, "total": 25, "id": "yoga_explanations", "title_en": "Yogas in your chart", "title_ne": "योग", "body": ["A yoga is a specific planetary combination that inclines the chart toward a particular tendency. Below are the yogas formed in your chart, with the strength of the planets involved and whether the running dasha is activating them."], "items": [{"label": "Gaja-Kesari Yoga", "confidence": "strong", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when Jupiter sits in an angle (kendra) from the Moon — a classic combination for good judgement, respect and steady fortune that tends to ripen with maturity. Its planets are strong here, so the result is dependable; the running dasha is activating it now.", "factors": ["Jupiter: a little strained, Shadbala Strong", "Moon: well supported, Shadbala Adequate", "Activated by the current dasha"]}, {"label": "Kemadruma Bhanga Raja Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The Moon is structurally isolated (2nd/12th empty) but a planet occupies an angle from the Lagna, cancelling Kemadruma — classically turning it into a Raja yoga for wealth and standing earned through one's own effort.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Chandra-Mangala Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "mixed", "text": "Formed when the Moon and Mars share a sign, giving enterprise and earning drive; the same energy benefits from a calm outlet so initiative doesn't turn into impatience. Its planets are strong here, so the result is dependable.", "factors": ["Moon: well supported, Shadbala Adequate", "Mars: a little strained, Shadbala Strong"]}, {"label": "Vanchana Chora Bheeti Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The Lagna holds a malefic with Gulika in a trine, or Gulika joins a kendra/trikona lord, or the lagna lord conjoins Rahu, Saturn or Ketu — a caution yoga classically linked to suspicion, fear of being cheated, swindled or robbed; clear boundaries and verifying people/deals directly help.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Veshi Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Planets occupy the 2nd house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for truthful speech, integrity and recognition through principled action.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Vasi Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Planets occupy the 12th house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for charity, spiritual merit and influence through selfless service.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Ubhayachari Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Planets flank the Sun on both the 2nd and 12th sides — a balanced Surya yoga for all-round ability, balanced temperament and success in both worldly and dharmic pursuits.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Pushkala Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna lord and the Moon share a sign — a Pushkala yoga for fame, popularity and a personality that draws people and opportunities.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Parijata Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The dispositor of the lagna lord's sign, or the Navamsa lord of that dispositor, falls in a kendra, trikona, or own/exaltation sign — a Parijata yoga for happiness in mid and later life, honoured by leaders.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Raja Yoga", "confidence": "strong", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the angular lord (Mars) and the trine lord (Jupiter) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong. Its planets are strong here, so the result is dependable; the running dasha is activating it now.", "factors": ["Jupiter: a little strained, Shadbala Strong", "Mars: a little strained, Shadbala Strong", "Activated by the current dasha"]}, {"label": "Raja Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the angular lord (Mars) and the trine lord (Moon) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong. Its planets are strong here, so the result is dependable.", "factors": ["Mars: a little strained, Shadbala Strong", "Moon: well supported, Shadbala Adequate"]}, {"label": "Bhagya Malika Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "mixed", "text": "All seven planets occupy the seven houses starting from the 9th house (a Malika/garland Nabhasa yoga) — classically: Religious, well-to-do, mighty and good.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Ardha Chandra Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "All seven planets occupy seven contiguous houses beginning from a Panapara or Apoklima house — an Ardha Chandra yoga for fine features, lifelong happiness and command.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Kedara Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "All seven planets spread across exactly 4 distinct sign(s) (a Sankhya Nabhasa yoga) — classically: Earns a livelihood by agriculture, helpful.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Dehakashta Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The lagna lord joins a malefic or sits in the 8th house — a Dehakashta yoga pointing to reduced bodily comfort.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Sada Sanchara Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "mixed", "text": "The lagna lord, or the lord of the sign it occupies, falls in a movable sign — a Sada Sanchara yoga for a life of travel, diplomacy or wandering.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Swaveeryaddhana Yoga (III)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 2nd lord holds an angle or trine from the lagna lord, or a benefic 2nd lord is deeply exalted or joined by an exalted planet — a Swaveeryaddhana yoga for self-earned wealth.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matrumooladdhana Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 2nd lord joins or is aspected by the 4th lord — money earned with a mother's help.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Daridra Yoga (149)", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The lagna lord is associated with a 6th/8th/12th lord and subjected to malefic aspects — dire poverty and want.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Bhratruvriddhi Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 3rd lord, Mars, or the 3rd house is joined or aspected by benefics — happiness through prosperous brothers.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Bandhubhisthyaktha Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 4th lord is associated with malefics or sits in an inimical/debilitated sign — deserted by relatives.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matrunasa Yoga (I)", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The Moon is hemmed in between, joined by, or aspected by malefics — a very early death of the mother.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matru Satrutwa Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The lagna and 4th lords are natural or temporal enemies — ill feeling between mother and son.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matru Sneha Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna and 4th lords share lordship, are natural or temporal friends, or the 4th is aspected by a benefic — cordial relations between mother and son.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Vahana Yoga (I)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna lord joins the 4th, 9th, or 11th house — material comforts and conveyances.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Anapathya Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "Jupiter and the lords of the Lagna, 7th and 5th are all weak — a caution yoga for childlessness or loss of children.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Satputra Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Jupiter rules the 5th while the Sun is favourably placed — a worthy, dutiful son.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Buddhimaturya Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "A benefic 5th lord is aspected by another benefic, or sits in a benefic sign — great intelligence and character.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Satkalatra Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 7th lord or Venus links to Jupiter or Mercury — a noble, chaste and virtuous spouse.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Raja Yoga (III)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Two to four planets possess Digbala (directional strength) — a ruler even from an ordinary family.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Raja Yoga (XIV)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "One of the 11th/9th/2nd lords holds an angle from the Moon while Jupiter rules the 2nd, 5th or 11th — greatness and high leadership.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Khalawata Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The Ascendant falls in a malefic sign, aspected by malefics — early baldness.", "factors": []}]}
