{"kind": "section", "index": 15, "total": 25, "id": "pursue_and_when", "title_en": "What to pursue & when", "title_ne": "के कुरामा लाग्ने र कहिले", "body": ["This section shows what to focus on and the best time for each one. Every life area below comes with the period that most favours it — try to line up your bigger decisions with those good times."], "items": [{"label": "Your strongest area", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "You are naturally good at learning, good judgement and steady growth — effort pays off fastest here, so put most of your energy into it. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (27 Sep 2030 → 3 Sep 2031)."}, {"label": "Career & work", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "Make your bigger moves in career, status and public role. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (3 Sep 2031 → 11 Oct 2032)."}, {"label": "Wealth & gains", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "Expand income streams, networks and aspirations. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (27 Sep 2030 → 3 Sep 2031)."}, {"label": "Relationships & partnership", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "Advance marriage, partnership or public collaboration. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (12 Apr 2029 → 8 Sep 2029)."}, {"label": "Learning, dharma & mentors", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "Invest in higher learning, travel, mentors and spiritual practice. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (3 Sep 2031 → 11 Oct 2032)."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 16, "total": 25, "id": "opportunities", "title_en": "Opportunities", "title_ne": "अवसर", "body": ["The 1st house (self) is well supported — a natural area to invest energy.", "The 11th house (gains) is well supported — a natural area to invest energy.", "Sunapha Yoga: Planets (other than the Sun) occupy the 2nd house from the Moon — a Chandra yoga for self-made prosperity and reputation built through personal effort.", "Vasi Yoga: Planets occupy the 12th house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for charity, spiritual merit and influence through selfless service.", "Budha-Aditya Yoga: Formed when the Sun and Mercury share a sign, favouring intelligence, clear expression and analytical or administrative ability (strongest when Mercury is not too close/combust).", "Neecha-Bhanga (Moon): Formed when Moon is debilitated but its strength is classically restored (neecha-bhanga) because a related lord — its sign dispositor or exaltation-lord — holds an angle. Early friction in this area then tends to convert into notable later strength.", "Raja Yoga: Formed when the angular lord (Sun) and the trine lord (Mercury) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong.", "Harihara Brahma Yoga: Formed by any of three classical combinations linking the 2nd, 7th or Lagna lord with specific benefic placements — a Harihara Brahma yoga for eminent scholarship, truthfulness and a helpful nature.", "Damni Yoga: All seven planets spread across exactly 6 distinct sign(s) (a Sankhya Nabhasa yoga) — classically: Highly charitable, always helping others, protector of cattle.", "Swaveeryaddhana Yoga (II): The dispositor of the lagna lord's Navamsa lord is strong and angular from the 2nd lord, or dignified — a Swaveeryaddhana yoga for self-earned wealth.", "Swaveeryaddhana Yoga (III): The 2nd lord holds an angle or trine from the lagna lord, or a benefic 2nd lord is deeply exalted or joined by an exalted planet — a Swaveeryaddhana yoga for self-earned wealth.", "Matrumooladdhana Yoga: The 2nd lord joins or is aspected by the 4th lord — money earned with a mother's help.", "Sumukha Yoga (II): Benefics join the 2nd house — an attractive, smiling face.", "Bhratruvriddhi Yoga: The 3rd lord, Mars, or the 3rd house is joined or aspected by benefics — happiness through prosperous brothers.", "Vahana Yoga (I): The lagna lord joins the 4th, 9th, or 11th house — material comforts and conveyances.", "Vahana Yoga (II): The 4th lord is exalted while its exaltation sign's lord holds an angle or trine — material comforts and conveyances.", "Bahuputra Yoga (II): The Navamsa lord of a planet linked to the 7th lord sits in the 1st, 2nd or 5th — a large number of children.", "Satkalatra Yoga: The 7th lord or Venus links to Jupiter or Mercury — a noble, chaste and virtuous spouse.", "Raja Yoga (II): A debilitated planet, uncombust or retrograde, still holds an angle or trine — rank equal to a ruler.", "Neechabhanga Raja Yoga (III): A debilitated planet's dispositor or exaltation-lord holds an angle from the Moon or Lagna — cancelling the debilitation and ushering in royal luck from humble beginnings.", "Raja Yoga (XI): The Navamsa lord of the Moon's sign holds an angle or trine from the Lagna or Mercury — a highly respectable position."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 17, "total": 25, "id": "cautions", "title_en": "Areas for caution", "title_ne": "सावधानी", "body": ["Keep a steady hand with transformation (the 8th house) — manage rather than force.", "Keep a steady hand with release (the 12th house) — manage rather than force.", "Shakata Yoga: The Moon occupies the 6th, 8th or 12th house from Jupiter — a 'cart' yoga of fluctuating fortune, where hard-won gains and setbacks tend to alternate through life.", "Duryoga: The 10th lord sits in a dusthana (6th, 8th or 12th) — a Duryoga where one's own efforts don't bring due credit, tempting shortcuts or deception.", "Daridra Yoga (149): The lagna lord is associated with a 6th/8th/12th lord and subjected to malefic aspects — dire poverty and want.", "Asatyavadi Yoga: The 2nd lord sits in a sign of Saturn or Mars while malefics occupy an angle and a trine — the native tends toward untruthfulness.", "Bandhubhisthyaktha Yoga: The 4th lord is associated with malefics or sits in an inimical/debilitated sign — deserted by relatives.", "Matrunasa Yoga (I): The Moon is hemmed in between, joined by, or aspected by malefics — a very early death of the mother.", "Matru Satrutwa Yoga: The lagna and 4th lords are natural or temporal enemies — ill feeling between mother and son.", "Aputra Yoga: The 5th lord sits in a dusthana — no issues at all.", "Guhyaroga Yoga: The Moon joins malefics in the Navamsa of Cancer or Scorpio — diseases of the private parts, piles or hernia.", "None of these are predictions of misfortune — they are areas where awareness and moderation protect your progress."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 18, "total": 25, "id": "practical_recommendations", "title_en": "Practical recommendations", "title_ne": "व्यावहारिक सुझाव", "body": ["Play to your strengths — learning, good judgement and steady growth. This is where progress comes easiest for you.", "Don't avoid your weaker side — energy, courage and taking action. Build it up slowly with small, regular habits instead of waiting until you feel ready.", "Save big decisions for the good times highlighted above, so you act when the timing is on your side.", "Pick one small habit for each priority below and stick with it for the next three months."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 19, "total": 25, "id": "spiritual_practices", "title_en": "Traditional spiritual practices (optional)", "title_ne": "पारम्परिक उपाय (वैकल्पिक)", "body": ["These are traditional, faith-based remedies offered as optional support — they are cultural practices, not requirements or guarantees.", "For strengthening Mars themes, classical texts suggest its weekday observance, charity associated with Mars, and respectful, calm conduct in that life area.", "Gratitude practices around Jupiter themes help you make the most of an existing strength.", "Above all, ethical action (sadachara) and steadiness are the remedies every tradition agrees on."], "optional": true}
{"kind": "section", "index": 20, "total": 25, "id": "planet_by_planet", "title_en": "Planet by planet", "title_ne": "ग्रह विश्लेषण", "body": [], "items": [{"label": "Sun (सूर्य)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Sun at its very best and very strong", "Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Sun is in Mesha at 25°42′ (birth star Bharani, quarter 4), in your 12th house; and is at its very best and very strong there. In life it stands for soul, vitality, father, authority and self-confidence. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Moon (चन्द्र)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D9: Moon dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong", "D1: Moon weak and needing conscious effort"], "text": "Moon is in Vrishchika at 2°59′ (birth star Vishakha, quarter 4), in your 7th house; and is weak and needing conscious effort there. In life it stands for mind, emotions, mother, comfort and the public. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Mars (मंगल)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Mars is in Kumbha at 17°53′ (birth star Shatabhisha, quarter 4), in your 10th house; and is in a neutral spot there. In life it stands for energy, courage, drive, siblings and property. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Mercury (बुध)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Mercury is in Mesha at 13°54′ (birth star Bharani, quarter 1), in your 12th house; and is in a neutral spot there; moving backwards for now (retrograde), so its themes turn inward and get revisited; very close to the Sun (combust), so its outer results take extra effort. In life it stands for intellect, communication, commerce and learning. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Jupiter (बृहस्पति)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D9: Jupiter dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Exceptional", "D1: Jupiter in an enemy sign"], "text": "Jupiter is in Mithuna at 18°09′ (birth star Ardra, quarter 4), in your 2nd house; and is a little strained there. In life it stands for wisdom, ethics, wealth, teachers, children and grace. Its overall strength is exceptional."}, {"label": "Venus (शुक्र)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Venus at its very best and very strong", "Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Venus is in Meena at 15°24′ (birth star Uttara Bhadrapada, quarter 4), in your 11th house; and is at its very best and very strong there. In life it stands for love, partnership, beauty, comfort and the arts. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Saturn (शनि)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Saturn is in Dhanu at 24°20′ (birth star Purva Ashadha, quarter 4), in your 8th house; and is in a neutral spot there; moving backwards for now (retrograde), so its themes turn inward and get revisited. In life it stands for discipline, endurance, work, service and longevity. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Rahu (राहु)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": [], "text": "Rahu is in Makara at 21°44′ (birth star Shravana, quarter 4), in your 9th house. In life it stands for ambition, foreign and unconventional paths, obsession."}, {"label": "Ketu (केतु)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["Dasha: Ketu runs the current mahadasha"], "text": "Ketu is in Karka at 21°44′ (birth star Ashlesha, quarter 2), in your 3rd house. In life it stands for detachment, intuition, past mastery and liberation."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 21, "total": 25, "id": "house_by_house", "title_en": "House by house", "title_ne": "भाव विश्लेषण", "body": [], "items": [{"label": "Self (house 1)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: 1st lord Venus well dignified", "Shadbala: 1st lord Strong"], "text": "This area of life is about self, body, vitality and overall life direction. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is at its very best and very strong there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Wealth (house 2)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 2nd lord Strong", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Jupiter", "D1: 2nd lord falls in the 12th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about wealth, speech, family lineage and nourishment. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Jupiter."}, {"label": "Courage (house 3)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: 3rd lord in a strong angle/trine (the 7th)", "Shadbala: 3rd lord Strong", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Ketu", "D1: 3rd lord Moon debilitated"], "text": "This area of life is about courage, effort, siblings, communication and skill. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about partnership, and is weak and needing conscious effort there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Ketu."}, {"label": "Home (house 4)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: 4th lord Sun well dignified", "Shadbala: 4th lord Strong", "D1: 4th lord falls in the 12th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about home, mother, inner peace, property and education. The planet in charge of it, Sun, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is at its very best and very strong there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Intelligence (house 5)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 5th lord Strong", "D1: 5th lord falls in the 12th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about intelligence, creativity, children and past merit. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Work (house 6)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: 6th lord Venus well dignified", "Shadbala: 6th lord Strong"], "text": "This area of life is about work, service, health, competition and obstacles. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is at its very best and very strong there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Partnership (house 7)", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 7th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 10th)", "Shadbala: 7th lord Strong", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Moon"], "text": "This area of life is about partnership, marriage, business and public dealings. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about career, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Moon."}, {"label": "Transformation (house 8)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 8th lord Exceptional", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Saturn"], "text": "This area of life is about transformation, shared resources, research and longevity. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about wealth, and is a little strained there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Saturn."}, {"label": "Fortune (house 9)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 9th lord Strong", "D1: 9th lord falls in the 8th (a difficult house)", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Rahu"], "text": "This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about transformation, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Rahu."}, {"label": "Career (house 10)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 10th lord Strong", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Mars", "D1: 10th lord falls in the 8th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about career, status, public role and worldly action. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about transformation, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Mars."}, {"label": "Gains (house 11)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Shadbala: 11th lord Exceptional", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Venus"], "text": "This area of life is about gains, networks, aspirations and elder siblings. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about wealth, and is a little strained there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Venus."}, {"label": "Release (house 12)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: 12th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 10th)", "Shadbala: 12th lord Strong", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Mercury", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Sun"], "text": "This area of life is about release, expenses, retreat, foreign lands and liberation. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about career, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Sun, Mercury."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 22, "total": 25, "id": "divisional_charts", "title_en": "Divisional charts (D-charts) summary", "title_ne": "वर्ग चक्र (D-चार्ट) सारांश", "body": ["Divisional (varga) charts subdivide each rashi of the birth chart into finer parts, and each one zooms in on a specific area of life. Below is a short reading of what every major D-chart is read for and how strong that area looks in this chart."], "items": [{"label": "D9 — Navamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Moon: steady and self-assured", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D9 chart (Navamsa) shows your marriage, dharma, fortune and the inner strength of every planet. Moon, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D10 — Dasamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Moon: steady and self-assured", "Mars: weak and needing conscious effort", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D10 chart (Dasamsa) shows your career, profession, status and public achievement. Moon, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Mars is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D7 — Saptamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Moon: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D7 chart (Saptamsa) shows your children, progeny and creative continuity. Moon is strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D4 — Chaturthamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Moon: weak and needing conscious effort, keeps its natal sign", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured", "Venus: weak and needing conscious effort"], "text": "The D4 chart (Chaturthamsa) shows your home, land, property and inner contentment. Jupiter, Moon are strong here, which helps this area. Moon, Venus are under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some 