ady and self-assured", "Saturn: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D20 chart (Vimsamsa) shows your spiritual practice, devotion and religious merit. Mars, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D27 — Bhamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Mars: keeps its natal sign", "Mercury: keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D27 chart (Bhamsa) shows your innate strengths, weaknesses and stamina. Saturn, Mars, Mercury are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D30 — Trimsamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: weak and needing conscious effort", "Moon: at its very best and very strong", "Jupiter: keeps its natal sign", "Venus: at its very best and very strong, keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D30 chart (Trimsamsa) shows your adversity, health risks and moral fibre. Moon, Venus, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Sun is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D60 — Shashtiamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Mars: at its very best and very strong", "Jupiter: keeps its natal sign", "Venus: weak and needing conscious effort", "Saturn: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D60 chart (Shashtiamsa) shows your the sum of past-life karma standing behind the whole chart. Mars, Jupiter, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Venus is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}]}
