{"kind": "section", "index": 0, "total": 25, "id": "executive_summary", "title_en": "Executive summary", "title_ne": "सारांश", "body": ["Three things set the tone of your whole chart: your rising sign (how you come across to others), your Moon (your emotions and mind), and your Sun (your core self). Here, Vrishchika is rising, your Moon is in Tula (birth star Swati), and your Sun is in Meena.", "In plain terms, you tend to come across to others as intense, private and strong-willed.", "The planet ruling your rising sign, Mars, is in your 3rd house and at its very best and very strong there, so overall your chart rests on a strong, well-supported foundation.", "Where you are now: you're in Mercury's main life period (mahadasha) until 16 Apr 2029, and the current sub-phase within it (antardasha) belongs to Saturn, running 7 Aug 2026 – 16 Apr 2029. The Life-period timeline section gives the full schedule with dates.", "Helpful combinations (yogas) active in your chart: Sunapha Yoga, Veshi Yoga, Budha-Aditya Yoga, Raja Yoga, Dhana Yoga, Mridanga Yoga, Harihara Brahma Yoga, Pasa Yoga, Swaveeryaddhana Yoga (II), Yukthi Samanwithavagmi Yoga (I), Bahuputra Yoga (II), Ekaputra Yoga, Satputra Yoga, Buddhimaturya Yoga, Theevrabuddhi Yoga, Putra Sukha Yoga, Bhagya Yoga, Raja Yoga (II), Raja Yoga (III), Raja Yoga (XI), Raja Yoga (XIV) — each is explained in plain words in the Yogas section below."], "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: lagna lord Mars dignified", "Shadbala: lagna lord strong", "Yogas: 21 supportive combination(s)"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 1, "total": 25, "id": "personality", "title_en": "Personality & temperament", "title_ne": "व्यक्तित्व", "body": ["To other people, you usually come across as intense, private and strong-willed (Vrishchika rising).", "How you present yourself is shaped most by Mars (the planet ruling your rising sign), so energy, courage and taking action is a big part of your outward style.", "Deeper down, your sense of self and drive is built around confidence and leadership (your Sun is in Meena).", "The way you think and communicate leans toward clear thinking, communication and learning."], "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Mars at its very best and very strong", "Shadbala: Strong"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 2, "total": 25, "id": "emotional_nature", "title_en": "Emotional nature", "title_ne": "भावनात्मक स्वभाव", "body": ["Emotionally, you tend to be friendly, fair and people-oriented, someone who values balance (your Moon is in Tula).", "Your sense of emotional security is mainly tied to release, expenses, retreat, foreign lands and liberation. Deliberate rest, a regular routine and supportive company clearly help keep you calm and settled.", "A helpful, friendly influence from Venus lends the mind extra protection and optimism."], "confidence": "tentative", "factors": []}
{"kind": "section", "index": 3, "total": 25, "id": "strengths", "title_en": "Core strengths", "title_ne": "बल पक्ष", "body": ["Your strongest areas are: discipline, patience and steady hard work; energy, courage and taking action; relationships, comfort and enjoying life; learning, good judgement and steady growth. These come more naturally to you, so you can lean on them and build on them with confidence."], "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Saturn dignified/strong", "Mars dignified/strong", "Venus dignified/strong", "Jupiter dignified/strong"]}
