{"kind": "section", "index": 5, "total": 25, "id": "career", "title_en": "Career & vocation", "title_ne": "पेशा / कर्म", "body": ["This area of life is about career, status, public role and worldly action. The planet in charge of it, Sun, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is well supported there (overall strength adequate).", "Your career direction is set by the planet that rules your career area, Sun, moving into your 5th house — so your public work blends with intelligence.", "Sun and Saturn together describe the balance between authority/visibility and disciplined hard work in your working life.", "You're currently in Mercury's main life period, which right now colours your career with study, communication, trade, writing and analytical work."], "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: 10th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 6, "total": 25, "id": "finances", "title_en": "Finances & wealth", "title_ne": "धन / वित्त", "body": ["This area of life is about wealth, speech, family lineage and nourishment. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is steady and self-assured there (overall strength strong).", "This area of life is about gains, networks, aspirations and elder siblings. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is weak and needing conscious effort there (overall strength weak).", "Jupiter, the planet naturally linked to wealth and good fortune, is in Meena (your 5th house) — steady and self-assured there.", "A wealth-forming Dhana yoga supports accumulation through steady earning and saving habits.", "Finances respond best to systematic saving; the chart describes tendencies, while habits decide outcomes."], "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 2nd lord Jupiter well dignified", "D1: 2nd lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)", "Shadbala: 2nd lord Strong", "D1: 11th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)", "Yoga: Dhana yoga present", "D1: 11th lord Mercury debilitated", "Shadbala: 11th lord Weak"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 7, "total": 25, "id": "relationships", "title_en": "Relationships & partnership", "title_ne": "सम्बन्ध", "body": ["This area of life is about partnership, marriage, business and public dealings. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about work, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Ketu.", "Venus, the planet linked to love and partnership, is in Mesha (your 6th house) — in a neutral spot there. It describes what you value and look for in closeness.", "A challenging influence on the partnership house suggests relationships mature through some testing — open communication and shared values smooth the path. This is a tendency, not a fixed outcome."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 7th lord Strong", "D1: 7th lord falls in the 6th (a difficult house)", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Ketu"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 8, "total": 25, "id": "family", "title_en": "Family & home", "title_ne": "परिवार", "body": ["This area of life is about home, mother, inner peace, property and education. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about transformation, and is well supported there (overall strength exceptional).", "This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength adequate).", "This area of life is about courage, effort, siblings, communication and skill. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about transformation, and is well supported there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Mars.", "The 4th reflects mother and home, the 9th the father and elders, the 2nd the wider family, and the 3rd siblings."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 4th lord Exceptional", "D1: 4th lord falls in the 8th (a difficult house)"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 9, "total": 25, "id": "health_wellbeing", "title_en": "Health & wellbeing", "title_ne": "स्वास्थ्य", "body": ["In Vedic astrology, your vitality is read from the rising sign, its ruling planet, and the Moon; the 6th house describes illness, recovery and daily routine.", "Your rising-sign ruler Mars (in your 3rd house, at its very best and very strong there) supports a robust constitution and quick recovery.", "This area of life is about work, service, health, competition and obstacles. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is at its very best and very strong there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Venus.", "This is wellbeing guidance from chart tendencies, not medical advice; consult a qualified professional for any concern."], "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Mars at its very best and very strong", "Shadbala: Strong"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 10, "total": 25, "id": "spiritual_growth", "title_en": "Spiritual growth", "title_ne": "आध्यात्मिक विकास", "body": ["This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength adequate).", "This area of life is about release, expenses, retreat, foreign lands and liberation. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about work, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Moon.", "Jupiter in house 5 points to where wisdom, ethics and mentorship naturally develop.", "Ketu in house 7 (Vrishabha) shows where you carry instinctive mastery and a pull toward detachment."], "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: 9th lord falls in the 12th (a difficult house)"]}
