{"kind": "section", "index": 12, "total": 25, "id": "life_journey", "title_en": "Life journey — past, present & future", "title_ne": "जीवन यात्रा — विगत, वर्तमान र भविष्य", "body": ["Your life is divided into long chapters (called mahadashas in astrology), and each one emphasises a different part of life. Below are the chapters you have already lived, the one running now, and the ones ahead — with ages — so you can see at a glance which stage of life emphasises what."], "items": [{"label": "Rahu life period (balance at birth) · age 0–2 (past)", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "30 Mar 1975 → 16 Apr 1977 (2 yrs): This chapter built experience around ambition, unconventional or foreign avenues and rapid change."}, {"label": "Jupiter life period · age 2–18 (past)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "16 Apr 1977 → 16 Apr 1993 (16 yrs): This chapter built experience around growth, wisdom, teaching, finances, children and good counsel."}, {"label": "Saturn life period · age 18–37 (past)", "confidence": "strong", "text": "16 Apr 1993 → 16 Apr 2012 (19 yrs): This chapter built experience around discipline, hard work, responsibility, structure and patience."}, {"label": "Mercury life period · age 37–54 (present · you are here)", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "16 Apr 2012 → 16 Apr 2029 (17 yrs): You are living this chapter now — study, communication, trade, writing and analytical work is foregrounded."}, {"label": "Ketu life period · age 54–61 (ahead)", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "16 Apr 2029 → 15 Apr 2036 (7 yrs): This coming chapter brings detachment, specialisation, inner work and spiritual turns to the fore."}, {"label": "Venus life period · age 61–81 (ahead)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "15 Apr 2036 → 15 Apr 2056 (20 yrs): This coming chapter brings relationships, comfort, creativity, the arts and material ease to the fore."}, {"label": "Sun life period · age 81–87 (ahead)", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "15 Apr 2056 → 16 Apr 2062 (6 yrs): This coming chapter brings leadership, recognition, dealings with authority and matters of the father to the fore."}, {"label": "Moon life period · age 87–97 (ahead)", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "16 Apr 2062 → 15 Apr 2072 (10 yrs): This coming chapter brings emotional life, home, public contact and care-giving to the fore."}, {"label": "Mars life period · age 97–104 (ahead)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "15 Apr 2072 → 16 Apr 2079 (7 yrs): This coming chapter brings drive, property, technical or competitive effort and bold initiative to the fore."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 13, "total": 25, "id": "dasha_timeline", "title_en": "Life-period timeline (with dates)", "title_ne": "जीवन-कालखण्ड तालिका", "body": ["The schedule of sub-periods inside your current Mercury life period, and the big life periods that follow — the most precise timing layer of your chart."], "items": [{"label": "Saturn sub-period · running now", "confidence": "strong", "text": "7 Aug 2026 → 16 Apr 2029: discipline — linked to your 8th house."}, {"label": "Ketu life period (next major chapter)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Begins 16 Apr 2029, lasting to 15 Apr 2036 (7 yrs): a detachment chapter."}, {"label": "Venus life period (next major chapter)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Begins 15 Apr 2036, lasting to 15 Apr 2056 (20 yrs): a relationships chapter."}, {"label": "Sun life period (next major chapter)", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Begins 15 Apr 2056, lasting to 16 Apr 2062 (6 yrs): a leadership chapter."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 14, "total": 25, "id": "outlook_12_months", "title_en": "Outlook — next 12 months", "title_ne": "आगामी १२ महिना", "body": ["The year ahead is led by Saturn's sub-period (through 16 Apr 2029), bringing discipline, hard work, responsibility, structure and patience to the fore.", "It is well placed (in your 8th house), so initiatives in its areas are favoured — a good window to push forward."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Dasha: Mercury runs the current mahadasha", "D1: Mercury weak and needing conscious effort", "Shadbala: Weak"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 15, "total": 25, "id": "pursue_and_when", "title_en": "What to pursue & when", "title_ne": "के कुरामा लाग्ने र कहिले", "body": ["This section shows what to focus on and the best time for each one. Every life area below comes with the period that most favours it — try to line up your bigger decisions with those good times."], "items": [{"label": "Your strongest area", "confidence": "strong", "text": "You are naturally good at discipline, patience and steady hard work — effort pays off fastest here, so put most of your energy into it. Best time for this: a good period running now (7 Aug 2026 → 16 Apr 2029)."}, {"label": "Career & work", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "Make your bigger moves in career, status and public role. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (15 Apr 2056 → 16 Apr 2062)."}, {"label": "Wealth & gains", "confidence": "mixed", "text": "Expand income streams, networks and aspirations. Best time for this: a good period running now (16 Apr 2012 → 16 Apr 2029)."}, {"label": "Relationships & partnership", "confidence": "moderate", "text": "Advance marriage, partnership or public collaboration. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (15 Apr 2036 → 15 Apr 2056)."}, {"label": "Learning, dharma & mentors", "confidence": "tentative", "text": "Invest in higher learning, travel, mentors and spiritual practice. Best time for this: an upcoming good period (16 Apr 2062 → 15 Apr 2072)."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 16, "total": 25, "id": "opportunities", "title_en": "Opportunities", "title_ne": "अवसर", "body": ["The 5th house (intelligence) is well supported — a natural area to invest energy.", "Sunapha Yoga: Planets (other than the Sun) occupy the 2nd house from the Moon — a Chandra yoga for self-made prosperity and reputation built through personal effort.", "Veshi Yoga: Planets occupy the 2nd house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for truthful speech, integrity and recognition through principled action.", "Budha-Aditya Yoga: Formed when the Sun and Mercury share a sign, favouring intelligence, clear expression and analytical or administrative ability (strongest when Mercury is not too close/combust).", "Raja Yoga: Formed when the angular lord (Sun) and the trine lord (Jupiter) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong.", "Dhana Yoga: Formed when the lords of income (2nd) and gains (11th) combine in one house — a wealth-forming pattern that rewards consistent earning and saving habits.", "Mridanga Yoga: The Navamsa lord of an exalted planet's sign sits in a kendra or trikona in a friendly, own or exalted sign while the lagna lord is strong — a Mridanga yoga for respect from rulers, fame and influence.", "Harihara Brahma Yoga: Formed by any of three classical combinations linking the 2nd, 7th or Lagna lord with specific benefic placements — a Harihara Brahma yoga for eminent scholarship, truthfulness and a helpful nature.", "Pasa Yoga: All seven planets spread across exactly 5 distinct sign(s) (a Sankhya Nabhasa yoga) — classically: Acquires wealth righteously, surrounded by friends and relatives.", "Swaveeryaddhana Yoga (II): The dispositor of the lagna lord's Navamsa lord is strong and angular from the 2nd lord, or dignified — a Swaveeryaddhana yoga for self-earned wealth.", "Yukthi Samanwithavagmi Yoga (I): The 2nd lord joins a benefic in an angle or trine, or is deeply exalted with Jupiter — the person becomes an eloquent, skilled speaker.", "Bahuputra Yoga (II): The Navamsa lord of a planet linked to the 7th lord sits in the 1st, 2nd or 5th — a large number of children.", "Ekaputra Yoga: The 5th lord joins an angle or trine — only one son.", "Satputra Yoga: Jupiter rules the 5th while the Sun is favourably placed — a worthy, dutiful son.", "Buddhimaturya Yoga: A benefic 5th lord is aspected by another benefic, or sits in a benefic sign — great intelligence and character.", "Theevrabuddhi Yoga: The Navamsa lord of a benefic 5th lord's sign is aspected by benefics — precocious, genius-level intelligence.", "Putra Sukha Yoga: Benefics occupy the 5th, or a strong 5th lord is aspected by benefics — immense happiness from children.", "Bhagya Yoga: A strong benefic in the Lagna, 3rd or 5th aspects the 9th — extremely fortunate, pleasure-loving and rich.", "Raja Yoga (II): A debilitated planet, uncombust or retrograde, still holds an angle or trine — rank equal to a ruler.", "Raja Yoga (III): Two to four planets possess Digbala (directional strength) — a ruler even from an ordinary family.", "Raja Yoga (XI): The Navamsa lord of the Moon's sign holds an angle or trine from the Lagna or Mercury — a highly respectable position.", "Raja Yoga (XIV): One of the 11th/9th/2nd lords holds an angle from the Moon while Jupiter rules the 2nd, 5th or 11th — greatness and high leadership."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 17, "total": 25, "id": "cautions", "title_en": "Areas for caution", "title_ne": "सावधानी", "body": ["Keep a steady hand with transformation (the 8th house) — manage rather than force.", "Keep a steady hand with release (the 12th house) — manage rather than force.", "Vanchana Chora Bheeti Yoga: The Lagna holds a malefic with Gulika in a trine, or Gulika joins a kendra/trikona lord, or the lagna lord conjoins Rahu, Saturn or Ketu — a caution yoga classically linked to suspicion, fear of being cheated, swindled or robbed; clear boundaries and verifying people/deals directly help.", "Shakata Yoga: The Moon occupies the 6th, 8th or 12th house from Jupiter — a 'cart' yoga of fluctuating fortune, where hard-won gains and setbacks tend to alternate through life.", "Dehakashta Yoga: The lagna lord joins a malefic or sits in the 8th house — a Dehakashta yoga pointing to reduced bodily comfort.", "Krisanga Yoga (I): The lagna lord occupies a dry sign or one owned by a dry planet — a Krisanga yoga for a lean body and bodily aches.", "Krisanga Yoga (II): The Navamsa Lagna is owned by a dry planet while malefics join the Lagna — a Krisanga yoga for a lean body and bodily aches.", "Daridra Yoga (149): The lagna lord is associated with a 6th/8th/12th lord and subjected to malefic aspects — dire poverty and want.", "Daridra Yoga (152): Natural malefics not owning the 9th or 10th occupy the Lagna, associated with the maraka lords — dire poverty and want.", "Bandhubhisthyaktha Yoga: The 4th lord is associated with malefics or sits in an inimical/debilitated sign — deserted by relatives.", "Matrunasa Yoga (II): The chain of Navamsa lords from the 4th lord resolves to a planet in a dusthana — a very early death of the mother.", "Matru Satrutwa Yoga: The lagna and 4th lords are natural or temporal enemies — ill feeling between mother and son.", "Kalatrashanda Yoga: The 7th lord joins the 6th with Venus — a frigid or sexually unresponsive wife.", "Khalawata Yoga: The Ascendant falls in a malefic sign, aspected by malefics — early baldness.", "None of these are predictions of misfortune — they are areas where awareness and moderation protect your progress."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 18, "total": 25, "id": "practical_recommendations", "title_en": "Practical recommendations", "title_ne": "व्यावहारिक सुझाव", "body": ["Play to your strengths — discipline, patience and steady hard work. This is where progress comes easiest for you.", "Don't avoid your weaker side — clear thinking, communication and learning. Build it up slowly with small, regular habits instead of waiting until you feel ready.", "Save big decisions for the good times highlighted above, so you act when the timing is on your side.", "Pick one small habit for each priority below and stick with it for the next three months."]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 19, "total": 25, "id": "spiritual_practices", "title_en": "Traditional spiritual practices (optional)", "title_ne": "पारम्परिक उपाय (वैकल्पिक)", "body": ["These are traditional, faith-based remedies offered as optional support — they are cultural practices, not requirements or guarantees.", "For strengthening Mercury themes, classical texts suggest its weekday observance, charity associated with Mercury, and respectful, calm conduct in that life area.", "Gratitude practices around Saturn themes help you make the most of an existing strength.", "Above all, ethical action (sadachara) and steadiness are the remedies every tradition agrees on."], "optional": true}
{"kind": "section", "index": 20, "total": 25, "id": "planet_by_planet", "title_en": "Planet by planet", "title_ne": "ग्रह विश्लेषण", "body": [], "items": [{"label": "Sun (सूर्य)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: Sun in a friendly sign"], "text": "Sun is in Meena at 15°12′ (birth star Uttara Bhadrapada, quarter 4), in your 5th house; and is well supported there. In life it stands for soul, vitality, father, authority and self-confidence. Its overall strength is adequate."}, {"label": "Moon (चन्द्र)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": [], "text": "Moon is in Tula at 18°29′ (birth star Swati, quarter 4), in your 12th house; and is in a neutral spot there. In life it stands for mind, emotions, mother, comfort and the public. Its overall strength is adequate."}, {"label": "Mars (मंगल)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Mars at its very best and very strong", "Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Mars is in Makara at 24°21′ (birth star Dhanishta, quarter 1), in your 3rd house; and is at its very best and very strong there. In life it stands for energy, courage, drive, siblings and property. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Mercury (बुध)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Dasha: Mercury runs the current mahadasha", "D1: Mercury weak and needing conscious effort", "Shadbala: Weak"], "text": "Mercury is in Meena at 0°16′ (birth star Purva Bhadrapada, quarter 4), in your 5th house; and is weak and needing conscious effort there. In life it stands for intellect, communication, commerce and learning. Its overall strength is weak."}, {"label": "Jupiter (बृहस्पति)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D1: Jupiter steady and self-assured", "Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Jupiter is in Meena at 12°55′ (birth star Uttara Bhadrapada, quarter 3), in your 5th house; and is steady and self-assured there; very close to the Sun (combust), so its outer results take extra effort. In life it stands for wisdom, ethics, wealth, teachers, children and grace. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Venus (शुक्र)", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["D9: Venus dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Strong"], "text": "Venus is in Mesha at 21°30′ (birth star Bharani, quarter 3), in your 6th house; and is in a neutral spot there. In life it stands for love, partnership, beauty, comfort and the arts. Its overall strength is strong."}, {"label": "Saturn (शनि)", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: Saturn in a friendly sign", "D9: Saturn dignified in navamsa", "Shadbala: Exceptional", "Dasha: Saturn runs the current antardasha"], "text": "Saturn is in Mithuna at 13°51′ (birth star Ardra, quarter 3), in your 8th house; and is well supported there. In life it stands for discipline, endurance, work, service and longevity. Its overall strength is exceptional."}, {"label": "Rahu (राहु)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D9: vargottama (same sign in navamsa — reinforced)"], "text": "Rahu is in Vrishchika at 14°14′ (birth star Anuradha, quarter 4), in your 1st house; in the same sign in both main charts (vargottama), which makes it noticeably stronger. In life it stands for ambition, foreign and unconventional paths, obsession."}, {"label": "Ketu (केतु)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D9: vargottama (same sign in navamsa — reinforced)"], "text": "Ketu is in Vrishabha at 14°14′ (birth star Rohini, quarter 2), in your 7th house; in the same sign in both main charts (vargottama), which makes it noticeably stronger. In life it stands for detachment, intuition, past mastery and liberation."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 21, "total": 25, "id": "house_by_house", "title_en": "House by house", "title_ne": "भाव विश्लेषण", "body": [], "items": [{"label": "Self (house 1)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: 1st lord Mars well dignified", "Shadbala: 1st lord Strong", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Rahu"], "text": "This area of life is about self, body, vitality and overall life direction. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is at its very best and very strong there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Rahu."}, {"label": "Wealth (house 2)", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 2nd lord Jupiter well dignified", "D1: 2nd lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)", "Shadbala: 2nd lord Strong"], "text": "This area of life is about wealth, speech, family lineage and nourishment. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is steady and self-assured there (overall strength strong)."}, {"label": "Courage (house 3)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 3rd lord Exceptional", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Mars", "D1: 3rd lord falls in the 8th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about courage, effort, siblings, communication and skill. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about transformation, and is well supported there (overall strength exceptional). Planets currently in this area: Mars."}, {"label": "Home (house 4)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 4th lord Exceptional", "D1: 4th lord falls in the 8th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about home, mother, inner peace, property and education. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about transformation, and is well supported there (overall strength exceptional)."}, {"label": "Intelligence (house 5)", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 5th lord Jupiter well dignified", "D1: 5th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)", "Shadbala: 5th lord Strong", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Mercury, Jupiter", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Sun"], "text": "This area of life is about intelligence, creativity, children and past merit. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is steady and self-assured there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Sun, Mercury, Jupiter."}, {"label": "Work (house 6)", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 6th lord Mars well dignified", "Shadbala: 6th lord Strong", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Venus"], "text": "This area of life is about work, service, health, competition and obstacles. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is at its very best and very strong there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Venus."}, {"label": "Partnership (house 7)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 7th lord Strong", "D1: 7th lord falls in the 6th (a difficult house)", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Ketu"], "text": "This area of life is about partnership, marriage, business and public dealings. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about work, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Ketu."}, {"label": "Transformation (house 8)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: 8th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)", "D1: 8th lord Mercury debilitated", "Shadbala: 8th lord Weak", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Saturn"], "text": "This area of life is about transformation, shared resources, research and longevity. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is weak and needing conscious effort there (overall strength weak). Planets currently in this area: Saturn."}, {"label": "Fortune (house 9)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: 9th lord falls in the 12th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength adequate)."}, {"label": "Career (house 10)", "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D1: 10th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)"], "text": "This area of life is about career, status, public role and worldly action. The planet in charge of it, Sun, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is well supported there (overall strength adequate)."}, {"label": "Gains (house 11)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: 11th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 5th)", "D1: 11th lord Mercury debilitated", "Shadbala: 11th lord Weak"], "text": "This area of life is about gains, networks, aspirations and elder siblings. The planet in charge of it, Mercury, currently sits in the part of your chart about intelligence, and is weak and needing conscious effort there (overall strength weak)."}, {"label": "Release (house 12)", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 12th lord Strong", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Moon", "D1: 12th lord falls in the 6th (a difficult house)"], "text": "This area of life is about release, expenses, retreat, foreign lands and liberation. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about work, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Moon."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 22, "total": 25, "id": "divisional_charts", "title_en": "Divisional charts (D-charts) summary", "title_ne": "वर्ग चक्र (D-चार्ट) सारांश", "body": ["Divisional (varga) charts subdivide each rashi of the birth chart into finer parts, and each one zooms in on a specific area of life. Below is a short reading of what every major D-chart is read for and how strong that area looks in this chart."], "items": [{"label": "D9 — Navamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Venus: steady and self-assured", "Saturn: very comfortable and strong"], "text": "The D9 chart (Navamsa) shows your marriage, dharma, fortune and the inner strength of every planet. Venus, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D10 — Dasamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Sun: at its very best and very strong", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured, keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D10 chart (Dasamsa) shows your career, profession, status and public achievement. Sun, Jupiter, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D7 — Saptamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Mercury: at its very best and very strong", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured", "Venus: weak and needing conscious effort"], "text": "The D7 chart (Saptamsa) shows your children, progeny and creative continuity. Mercury, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Venus is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D4 — Chaturthamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort, keeps its natal sign", "Venus: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D4 chart (Chaturthamsa) shows your home, land, property and inner contentment. Venus, Mercury are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D12 — Dwadashamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Moon: at its very best and very strong", "Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort, keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D12 chart (Dwadashamsa) shows your parents, lineage and inherited karma. Moon, Mercury are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D24 — Chaturvimsamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Moon: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D24 chart (Chaturvimsamsa) shows your education, learning and scholarship. Moon is strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D2 — Hora", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong", "Moon: steady and self-assured", "Jupiter: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D2 chart (Hora) shows your wealth, resources and material sustenance. Sun, Moon, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D3 — Drekkana", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort, keeps its natal sign", "Jupiter: at its very best and very strong", "Saturn: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D3 chart (Drekkana) shows your siblings, courage and personal initiative. Jupiter, Saturn, Mercury are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D16 — Shodashamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong", "Mars: steady and self-assured", "Venus: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D16 chart (Shodashamsa) shows your vehicles, comforts and material pleasures. Sun, Mars, Venus are strong her