{"kind": "section", "index": 6, "total": 23, "id": "finances", "title_en": "Finances & wealth", "title_ne": "धन / वित्त", "body": ["This area of life is about wealth, speech, family lineage and nourishment. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about career, and is well supported there (overall strength strong).", "This area of life is about gains, networks, aspirations and elder siblings. The planet in charge of it, Jupiter, currently sits in the part of your chart about career, and is well supported there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Sun, Mars, Mercury, Saturn.", "Jupiter, the planet naturally linked to wealth and good fortune, is in Vrishchika (your 10th house) — well supported there.", "A wealth-forming Dhana yoga supports accumulation through steady earning and saving habits.", "Finances respond best to systematic saving; the chart describes tendencies, while habits decide outcomes."], "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["D1: 2nd lord in a strong angle/trine (the 10th)", "Shadbala: 2nd lord Strong", "D1: 11th lord in a strong angle/trine (the 10th)", "Shadbala: 11th lord Strong", "D1: natural benefic(s) present — Mercury", "D1: malefic(s) in an upachaya house (strengthening here) — Sun, Mars, Saturn", "Yoga: Dhana yoga present"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 7, "total": 23, "id": "relationships", "title_en": "Relationships & partnership", "title_ne": "सम्बन्ध", "body": ["This area of life is about partnership, marriage, business and public dealings. The planet in charge of it, Sun, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is well supported there (overall strength borderline).", "Venus, the planet linked to love and partnership, is in Makara (your 12th house) — well supported there. It describes what you value and look for in closeness."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["D1: Venus well supported", "Shadbala: 7th lord Borderline"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 8, "total": 23, "id": "family", "title_en": "Family & home", "title_ne": "परिवार", "body": ["This area of life is about home, mother, inner peace, property and education. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is well supported there (overall strength strong). Planets currently in this area: Ketu.", "This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is well supported there (overall strength strong).", "This area of life is about courage, effort, siblings, communication and skill. The planet in charge of it, Mars, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is well supported there (overall strength adequate). Planets currently in this area: Moon.", "The 4th reflects mother and home, the 9th the father and elders, the 2nd the wider family, and the 3rd siblings."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 4th lord Strong", "D1: 4th lord falls in the 12th (a difficult house)", "D1: natural malefic(s) present — Ketu"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 9, "total": 23, "id": "health_wellbeing", "title_en": "Health & wellbeing", "title_ne": "स्वास्थ्य", "body": ["In Vedic astrology, your vitality is read from the rising sign, its ruling planet, and the Moon; the 6th house describes illness, recovery and daily routine.", "Your rising-sign ruler Saturn (in your 11th house, in a neutral spot there) asks for proactive self-care — regular sleep, movement and stress management have outsized benefit.", "This area of life is about work, service, health, competition and obstacles. The planet in charge of it, Moon, currently sits in the part of your chart about courage, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength adequate).", "This is wellbeing guidance from chart tendencies, not medical advice; consult a qualified professional for any concern."], "confidence": "tentative", "factors": ["D9: Saturn weak in navamsa"]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 10, "total": 23, "id": "spiritual_growth", "title_en": "Spiritual growth", "title_ne": "आध्यात्मिक विकास", "body": ["This area of life is about fortune, dharma, higher learning, mentors and the father. The planet in charge of it, Venus, currently sits in the part of your chart about release, and is well supported there (overall strength strong).", "This area of life is about release, expenses, retreat, foreign lands and liberation. The planet in charge of it, Saturn, currently sits in the part of your chart about gains, and is in a neutral spot there (overall strength adequate). Planets currently in this area: Venus.", "Jupiter in house 10 points to where wisdom, ethics and mentorship naturally develop.", "Ketu in house 4 (Vrishabha) shows where you carry instinctive mastery and a pull toward detachment."], "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Shadbala: 9th lord Strong", "D1: 9th lord falls in the 12th (a difficult house)"]}
