{"kind": "section", "index": 20, "total": 23, "id": "divisional_charts", "title_en": "Divisional charts (D-charts) summary", "title_ne": "वर्ग चक्र (D-चार्ट) सारांश", "body": ["Divisional (varga) charts subdivide each rashi of the birth chart into finer parts, and each one zooms in on a specific area of life. Below is a short reading of what every major D-chart is read for and how strong that area looks in this chart."], "items": [{"label": "D9 — Navamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: vargottama", "Mars: vargottama", "Mercury: steady and self-assured", "Jupiter: vargottama", "Venus: weak and needing conscious effort", "Saturn: weak and needing conscious effort"], "text": "The D9 chart (Navamsa) shows your marriage, dharma, fortune and the inner strength of every planet. Mercury, Sun, Mars, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Venus, Saturn are under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D10 — Dasamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Jupiter: keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D10 chart (Dasamsa) shows your career, profession, status and public achievement. Jupiter, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D7 — Saptamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Venus: keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D7 chart (Saptamsa) shows your children, progeny and creative continuity. Venus, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D4 — Chaturthamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Venus: steady and self-assured", "Saturn: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D4 chart (Chaturthamsa) shows your home, land, property and inner contentment. Venus, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D12 — Dwadashamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Sun: weak and needing conscious effort", "Moon: weak and needing conscious effort", "Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Saturn: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D12 chart (Dwadashamsa) shows your parents, lineage and inherited karma. Saturn is strong here, which helps this area. Sun, Moon, Mercury are under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D24 — Chaturvimsamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Moon: weak and needing conscious effort", "Venus: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D24 chart (Chaturvimsamsa) shows your education, learning and scholarship. Venus is strong here, which helps this area. Moon is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D2 — Hora", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Moon: steady and self-assured", "Mars: weak and needing conscious effort", "Jupiter: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D2 chart (Hora) shows your wealth, resources and material sustenance. Moon, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Mars is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D3 — Drekkana", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong", "Mercury: keeps its natal sign", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured", "Venus: weak and needing conscious effort", "Saturn: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D3 chart (Drekkana) shows your siblings, courage and personal initiative. Sun, Jupiter, Mercury, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Venus is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D16 — Shodashamsa", "confidence": 