arity": "benefic", "text": "The dispositor of the lagna lord's sign, or the Navamsa lord of that dispositor, falls in a kendra, trikona, or own/exaltation sign — a Parijata yoga for happiness in mid and later life, honoured by leaders.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Raja Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the angular lord (Mars) and the trine lord (Mercury) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong. Strength is mixed — some support, some friction.", "factors": ["Mars: well supported, Shadbala Adequate, vargottama, combust", "Mercury: in a neutral spot, Shadbala Strong"]}, {"label": "Raja Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the angular lord (Mars) and the trine lord (Saturn) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong. Strength is mixed — some support, some friction.", "factors": ["Mars: well supported, Shadbala Adequate, vargottama, combust", "Saturn: in a neutral spot, Shadbala Adequate"]}, {"label": "Raja Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the angular lord (Saturn) and the trine lord (Mercury) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong. Its planets are strong here, so the result is dependable.", "factors": ["Mercury: in a neutral spot, Shadbala Strong", "Saturn: in a neutral spot, Shadbala Adequate"]}, {"label": "Raja Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the angular lord (Sun) and the trine lord (Mercury) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong. Strength is mixed — some support, some friction.", "factors": ["Mercury: in a neutral spot, Shadbala Strong", "Sun: well supported, Shadbala Borderline, vargottama"]}, {