entative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 4th lord in the 12th, aspected by a malefic — loses all house property.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Bandhu Pujya Yoga (II)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 4th house or its lord has the association or aspect of Jupiter — respected and loved by relatives and friends.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Kapata Yoga (I)", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 4th house is joined by a malefic while the 4th lord is afflicted by malefics — a Kapata yoga for a hypocritical streak.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Nishkapata Yoga (I)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 4th house is occupied by a benefic, a dignified planet, or is itself a benefic sign — a Nishkapata yoga for a pure heart that hates secrecy and hypocrisy.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matru Sneha Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna and 4th lords share lordship, are natural or temporal friends, or the 4th is aspected by a benefic — cordial relations between mother and son.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Vahana Yoga (I)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna lord joins the 4th, 9th, or 11th house — material comforts and conveyances.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Buddhimaturya Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "A benefic 5th lord is aspected by another benefic, or sits in a benefic sign — great intelligence and character.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Satkalatra Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 7th lord or Venus links to Jupiter or Mercury — a noble, chaste and virtuous spouse.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Bhaga Chumbana Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 7th lord joins Venus in the 4th, or the lagna lord is debilitated — indulgence in sensual pleasures.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Raja Yoga (III)", "confidence": "moderate", "po