{"kind": "section", "index": 22, "total": 25, "id": "divisional_charts", "title_en": "Divisional charts (D-charts) summary", "title_ne": "वर्ग चक्र (D-चार्ट) सारांश", "body": ["Divisional (varga) charts subdivide each rashi of the birth chart into finer parts, and each one zooms in on a specific area of life. Below is a short reading of what every major D-chart is read for and how strong that area looks in this chart."], "items": [{"label": "D9 — Navamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong", "Mars: steady and self-assured", "Mercury: steady and self-assured", "Venus: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D9 chart (Navamsa) shows your marriage, dharma, fortune and the inner strength of every planet. Sun, Mars, Mercury, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D10 — Dasamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Moon: at its very best and very strong", "Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Venus: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D10 chart (Dasamsa) shows your career, profession, status and public achievement. Moon, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D7 — Saptamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Mars: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D7 chart (Saptamsa) shows your children, progeny and creative continuity. Mars is strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D4 — Chaturthamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Mars: keeps its natal sign", "Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Jupiter: keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D4 chart (Chaturthamsa) shows your home, land, property and inner contentment. Mars, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D12 — Dwadashamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Venus: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D12 chart (Dwadashamsa) shows your parents, lineage and inherited karma. Venus is strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D24 — Chaturvimsamsa", "confidence": "mixed", "factors": ["Mercury: weak and needing conscious effort", "Jupiter: steady and self-assured", "Venus: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D24 chart (Chaturvimsamsa) shows your education, learning and scholarship. Jupiter, Venus are strong here, which helps this area. Mercury is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks mixed — some support and some challenges."}, {"label": "D2 — Hora", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Moon: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D2 chart (Hora) shows your wealth, resources and material sustenance. Moon is strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D3 — Drekkana", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: at its very best and very strong", "Mars: keeps its natal sign", "Mercury: keeps its natal sign", "Jupiter: keeps its natal sign", "Venus: at its very best and very strong", "Saturn: weak and needing conscious effort, keeps its natal sign"], "text": "The D3 chart (Drekkana) shows your siblings, courage and personal initiative. Sun, Venus, Mars, Mercury, Jupiter, Saturn are strong here, which helps this area. Saturn is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D16 — Shodashamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: very comfortable and strong", "Jupiter: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D16 chart (Shodashamsa) shows your vehicles, comforts and material pleasures. Sun, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D20 — Vimsamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Mars: keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D20 chart (Vimsamsa) shows your spiritual practice, devotion and religious merit. Saturn, Mars are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D27 — Bhamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Moon: at its very best and very strong", "Mars: at its very best and very strong", "Mercury: keeps its natal sign", "Venus: steady and self-assured"], "text": "The D27 chart (Bhamsa) shows your innate strengths, weaknesses and stamina. Moon, Mars, Venus, Mercury are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}, {"label": "D30 — Trimsamsa", "confidence": "moderate", "factors": ["Sun: keeps its natal sign", "Mars: steady and self-assured", "Venus: weak and needing conscious effort", "Saturn: very comfortable and strong"], "text": "The D30 chart (Trimsamsa) shows your adversity, health risks and moral fibre. Mars, Saturn, Sun are strong here, which helps this area. Venus is under some strain, so this part needs more care. Overall, this area looks reasonably supported."}, {"label": "D60 — Shashtiamsa", "confidence": "strong", "factors": ["Moon: at its very best and very strong", "Mercury: steady and self-assured", "Jupiter: keeps its natal sign", "Saturn: at its very best and very strong"], "text": "The D60 chart (Shashtiamsa) shows your the sum of past-life karma standing behind the whole chart. Moon, Mercury, Saturn, Jupiter are strong here, which helps this area. Overall, this area looks strong and well-supported."}]}
{"kind": "section", "index": 23, "total": 25, "id": "yoga_explanations", "title_en": "Yogas in your chart", "title_ne": "योग", "body": ["A yoga is a specific planetary combination that inclines the chart toward a particular tendency. Below are the yogas formed in your chart, with the strength of the planets involved and whether the running dasha is activating them."], "items": [{"label": "Gaja-Kesari Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when Jupiter sits in an angle (kendra) from the Moon — a classic combination for good judgement, respect and steady fortune that tends to ripen with maturity. Strength is mixed — some support, some friction.", "factors": ["Jupiter: well supported, Shadbala Borderline", "Moon: in a neutral spot, Shadbala Strong"]}, {"label": "Sunapha Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Planets (other than the Sun) occupy the 2nd house from the Moon — a Chandra yoga for self-made prosperity and reputation built through personal effort.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Veshi Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Planets occupy the 2nd house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for truthful speech, integrity and recognition through principled action.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Vasi Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Planets occupy the 12th house from the Sun — a Surya yoga for charity, spiritual merit and influence through selfless service.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Ubhayachari Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Planets flank the Sun on both the 2nd and 12th sides — a balanced Surya yoga for all-round ability, balanced temperament and success in both worldly and dharmic pursuits.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Budha-Aditya Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the Sun and Mercury share a sign, favouring intelligence, clear expression and analytical or administrative ability (strongest when Mercury is not too close/combust). Its planets are on the weaker side, so the result needs extra effort to show.", "factors": ["Sun: well supported, Shadbala Adequate", "Mercury: in a neutral spot, Shadbala Borderline, combust"]}, {"label": "Raja Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed when the angular lord (Jupiter) and the trine lord (Saturn) join in one house — a Raja-yoga pattern supporting rise in status, provided the planets involved are reasonably strong. Strength is mixed — some support, some friction; the running dasha is activating it now.", "factors": ["Jupiter: well supported, Shadbala Borderline", "Saturn: weak and needing conscious effort, Shadbala Strong", "Activated by the current dasha"]}, {"label": "Dhana Malika Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "mixed", "text": "All seven planets occupy the seven houses starting from the 2nd house (a Malika/garland Nabhasa yoga) — classically: Very wealthy, dutiful, resolute and unsympathetic.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Harihara Brahma Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Formed by any of three classical combinations linking the 2nd, 7th or Lagna lord with specific benefic placements — a Harihara Brahma yoga for eminent scholarship, truthfulness and a helpful nature.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Ardha Chandra Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "All seven planets occupy seven contiguous houses beginning from a Panapara or Apoklima house — an Ardha Chandra yoga for fine features, lifelong happiness and command.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Pasa Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "All seven planets spread across exactly 5 distinct sign(s) (a Sankhya Nabhasa yoga) — classically: Acquires wealth righteously, surrounded by friends and relatives.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Sareera Soukhya Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna lord, Jupiter or Venus occupies an angle — a Sareera Soukhya yoga for long life, wealth and political favour.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Dehakashta Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The lagna lord joins a malefic or sits in the 8th house — a Dehakashta yoga pointing to reduced bodily comfort.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Rogagrastha Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The lagna lord in the ascendant joins a 6th/8th/12th lord, or a weak lagna lord sits in an angle or trine — a Rogagrastha yoga for a delicate constitution prone to sickness.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Krisanga Yoga (I)", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The lagna lord occupies a dry sign or one owned by a dry planet — a Krisanga yoga for a lean body and bodily aches.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Sada Sanchara Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "mixed", "text": "The lagna lord, or the lord of the sign it occupies, falls in a movable sign — a Sada Sanchara yoga for a life of travel, diplomacy or wandering.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Asatyavadi Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 2nd lord sits in a sign of Saturn or Mars while malefics occupy an angle and a trine — the native tends toward untruthfulness.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Sumukha Yoga (II)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Benefics join the 2nd house — an attractive, smiling face.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Sraddhannabhuktha Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "Saturn owns or joins the 2nd lord, or the 2nd is aspected by a debilitated Saturn — food from death ceremonies.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Bhratruvriddhi Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 3rd lord, Mars, or the 3rd house is joined or aspected by benefics — happiness through prosperous brothers.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Yuddhatpaschaddrudha Yoga", "confidence": "mixed", "polarity": "mixed", "text": "The 3rd lord in a fixed sign and Navamsa, whose sign lord is debilitated — courage grows once the fight has begun.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Bandhu Pujya Yoga (II)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 4th house or its lord has the association or aspect of Jupiter — respected and loved by relatives and friends.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Bandhubhisthyaktha Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 4th lord is associated with malefics or sits in an inimical/debilitated sign — deserted by relatives.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matrunasa Yoga (I)", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The Moon is hemmed in between, joined by, or aspected by malefics — a very early death of the mother.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Kapata Yoga (I)", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 4th house is joined by a malefic while the 4th lord is afflicted by malefics — a Kapata yoga for a hypocritical streak.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Nishkapata Yoga (I)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 4th house is occupied by a benefic, a dignified planet, or is itself a benefic sign — a Nishkapata yoga for a pure heart that hates secrecy and hypocrisy.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Nishkapata Yoga (II)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna lord joins the 4th house with or aspected by a benefic — a Nishkapata yoga for a pure heart that hates secrecy and hypocrisy.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matru Satrutwa Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The lagna and 4th lords are natural or temporal enemies — ill feeling between mother and son.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Matru Sneha Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna and 4th lords share lordship, are natural or temporal friends, or the 4th is aspected by a benefic — cordial relations between mother and son.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Vahana Yoga (I)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The lagna lord joins the 4th, 9th, or 11th house — material comforts and conveyances.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Aputra Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "The 5th lord sits in a dusthana — no issues at all.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Satkalatra Yoga", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "The 7th lord or Venus links to Jupiter or Mercury — a noble, chaste and virtuous spouse.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Raja Yoga (III)", "confidence": "moderate", "polarity": "benefic", "text": "Two to four planets possess Digbala (directional strength) — a ruler even from an ordinary family.", "factors": []}, {"label": "Vrana Yoga", "confidence": "tentative", "polarity": "caution", "text": "A malefic 6th lord occupies the Lagna, 8th or 10th — tumours, boils or cancer.", "factors": []}]}
